{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:unetaneh_toqef_in_hebrew/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֵין קִצְבָה לִשְׁנוֹתֶיךָ. וְאֵין "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_unetaneh_toqef_variant_3"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קֵצֶה"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קֵץ"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" לְאֹרֶךְ יָמֶיךָ. וְאֵין לְשַׁעֵר מַרְכְּבוֹת כְּבוֹדֶךָ. וְאֵין לְפָרֵשׁ עֵילוּם שְׁמֶךָ. שִׁמְךָ נָאֶה לְךָ וְאַתָּה נָאֶה לִשְׁמֶךָ. וּשְׁמֵנוּ קָרָאתָ בִּשְׁמֶךָ:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader_and_congregation","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קו״ח"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קהל וחזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:unetaneh_toqef_in_hebrew/10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עֲשֵׂה לְמַעַן שְׁמֶךָ. וְקַדֵּשׁ אֶת שִׁמְךָ עַל מַקְדִּישֵׁי שְׁמֶךָ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
